{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415487","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415487","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1041548701:1":{"text":"Where has Daimon gone this time? That boy... he's always a cause for concern.","source_cn":"戴蒙又跑到哪里去了？这孩子，真让人担心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56F2B27646554E39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041548702:1":{"text":"Looking for your kid, huh?","source_cn":"你在找你的孩子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC560EAC560CCE75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041548703:1":{"text":"Have you seen a boy wrapped in bandages?","source_cn":"你看到一个身上缠着绷带的小男孩了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84903DBC7230F466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548704:1":{"text":"Hmm... nope, can't say I have.","source_cn":"老实说，没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6B77201EBE164DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548705:1":{"text":"Then this doesn't concern you.","source_cn":"那这与你无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19BDC9B5DB32F7CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548706:1":{"text":"I hear you, I hear you—but hey, kids are trouble, aren't they? Always keeping us on our toes.","source_cn":"我明白我明白，孩子们就是如此淘气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB05BE5BCE5347D61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548707:1":{"text":"I've got one myself, so I know exactly how you feel.","source_cn":"我也有孩子，太能理解你的心情了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB67399CB7D4E557E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548708:1":{"text":"You have a child...?","source_cn":"你的孩子……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09A93968294DAC80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548709:1":{"text":"A feisty little meerkat—always biting folks, sneaking off to who-knows-where. Honestly, I can't keep track of it half the time!","source_cn":"一只调皮的小狐獴，总是闯祸，还咬人呢，现在也不知道偷跑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2B874A0214926B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548710:1":{"text":"So yeah, I get it. Kids—or, uh, meerkats—can be a handful. If you need to vent, I'm all ears.","source_cn":"所以我很能理解你的焦急，可以跟我说说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEC0D8BB34028288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548711:1":{"text":"... I'm searching for my son, Daimon. One moment he's beside me, and the next, he's vanished. He's probably off playing somewhere again, without a warning.","source_cn":"……我在找我的儿子戴蒙，我一转头他就不见了，估计是又跑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF22F6DD13D126163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041548712:1":{"text":"That kid... He should at least tell me before running off.","source_cn":"这孩子，至少应该在出门前先跟我说一声啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x088560D121941996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041548713:1":{"text":"Ah, I know the type. You think they're settled, then bam—they're gone. Worrying, isn't it?","source_cn":"我懂我懂，小家伙们一声不吱就消失实在不让人放心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x375A745D75B06965","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041548714:1":{"text":"You seem unusually laid-back for someone with parenting experience. Perhaps you have some advice to offer?","source_cn":"那么，你是位经验丰富的家长了？或许我可以听听你的建议……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x525A3A6230837C7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:雪米拉":{"text":"Shemira","source":"雪米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"Smokey","source":"阿熏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}